<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Health, Oxford.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Health, Oxford.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen said it upgraded United Healthcare Corp to strong buy from buy and Oxford Health Plans Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Oxford rose 1-3/4 to 57-3/4 and United Health added 2-1/8 to 46-7/8.</p>
</text>
